defn undefined [] (abstract \"TBI\"))\n\n(t/defn clazz [x :- t/Any] :- (t/U Class nil) (class x))\n(t/ann show [t/Any -> String])\n(defmulti show clazz)\n(defmethod show :default [x] (abstract \"show\"))\n"}}]}
